  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The Australian Performing Arts Conservatory (APAC) is a performing arts institution in Brisbane, Australia, with over three decades of experience. You'll find that APAC offers specialised training in Screen Production, Song &amp; Dance, and Acting. Whether you're passionate about acting, production, or performance, APAC provides you with the facilities and experiences to excel in the competitive world of the performing arts.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>You’ll have a supportive and dynamic student life at APAC. Not just that, you also get comprehensive support services, including academic assistance, personal counseling, and emergency services.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>While APAC does not offer on-campus accommodation, it assists you in finding suitable housing options in Brisbane. You can also choose local homestays, where citizens offer accommodation to international students like you.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>APAC's campus offers you modern facilities, including dance, drama, and film studios, alongside editing suites, according to your chosen programs.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
